NOTICE
======
Driving distances in instances/*.csv ([distances_km] sections) were queried
from the Amap (autoNavi) open platform API (c) Amap. They are included here
in derived form (site-to-site driving-distance matrices) for research
reproducibility. Facility coordinates were geocoded from public POI search;
backfill/landfill anchors use representative coordinates (see paper Sec. 6.1).
Demand realizations are synthetic (literature-calibrated tonnages at real
sub-district locations).
